          "id": "60e0676d5c0d6b74dea9a8407bf50a1de6f1944d",
          "message": "fix: Ensure that the experiment_api feature compiles\n\nThe command\n\n```\ncargo check --workspace --features experiment_api --all-targets\n```\n\nwould fail, because some of the broker binaries require the tokio\ndependencies and some require access to the internal API. Use of the\ninternal API is now enabled for these features, and experiment_api pulls\nin the tokio dependency.\n\nWe also added a regression test to make sure the experiment_api feature\ncompiles on its own.",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-31T17:01:20+01:00",
          "tree_id": "e281b143dbb6fe39b6823137e10177009ed33708",
          "url": "https://github.com/rosenpass/rosenpass/commit/60e0676d5c0d6b74dea9a8407bf50a1de6f1944d"
